    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12359" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Dāvus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Davos</span></b> ), i, m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a name given to Roman
